        ".............xSSLLwwwwwSxxxxxxxxxxxSLLwwwwSxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxSLwwSxxxxxxxxSLLLLLLwwSSw.............",
        ".............SLLLLwwwwwwSSxxxxxxxxSLLLwwwwwSxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxSSLLwwwSSSxxxxxLLLLLLLwwrrw.............",
